        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia Urban Single Cylinder Stainless Steel Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Omnia Urban Dummy Stainless Steel Handleset is perfect for modern homes. This stainless steel front door handle has a resilient brushed stainless steel finish. The Omnia Urban Front Door Lock features a 1 inch high security stainless steel deadbolt and stainless latch. It fits a standard 2-1/8 inch bore hole door prep with 5-1/2 inch Center to Center spacing. This single cylinder handleset is also Panic Proof (turning the inside door lever will unlock the deadbolt for easy quick emergency exits).\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Panic Proof:</b> Latchbolt operates by lever on the inside and a thumbpiece on the outside. Deadbolt activated by key outside and turnpiece inside. Turning of inside lever will retract both dead-bolt and latchbolt at the same time.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available matching <a href=\"/products/omnia-urban-dummy-stainless-steel-handleset\"><b>Urban Dummy Handleset</b></a> for the inactive door on a double door pair.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Urban Entrance Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solid Stainless Steel Trim</li>\r\n<li>Panic Proof</li>\r\n<li>Function: Single Cylinder (Keyed outside with Thumbturn inside)</li>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage \"C\" Keyway</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications:</b> for Omnia Urban Stainless Steel Handleset\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Stainless Steel Trim</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Brushed Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Bore Spacing: 5-1/2\" Center to Center (CTC)</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Overall Height: 16-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Top Plate Height: 10-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Top Plate Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Handle Projection: 2-3⁄8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Bottom Mount Length: 2\" square</li>\r\n<li>Interior Plate Height: 10-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Plate Width: 2-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" to 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt: 1\" Stainless Steel</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Omnia Urban Single Cylinder Stainless Steel Handleset",
                "description": "The Omnia Urban Dummy Stainless Steel Handleset is perfect for modern homes. This stainless steel front door handle has a resilient brushed stainless steel finish. The Omnia Urban Front Door Lock features a 1 inch high security stainless steel deadbolt and stainless latch. It fits a standard 2-1/8 inch bore hole door prep with 5-1/2 inch Center to Center spacing. This single cylinder handleset is also Panic Proof (turning the inside door lever will unlock the deadbolt for easy quick emergency exits).\r\n",
                "keywords": "OMN-Urban-F Omnia Contemporary Satin Stainless  Handlesets, Omnia Urban Single Cylinder Stainless Steel Handlesets, stainless Contemporary handlesets, stainless front door handles,"
